%include config_extra.fdf

# calc.fdf template for the optical direction folders of bulk Si.
# It deliberately has NO k-grid and no MD directives: stb-optical writes the SCF k-grid (a
# required input -- SIESTA would sample Gamma only) and the single-point guards into each
# folder's config_extra.fdf. Basis: TZP with a small PAO.EnergyShift, because optical transitions
# involve the unoccupied bands, which a small or confined basis describes poorly (README 5.4).
SystemLabel siesta
%include structure.fdf

XC.functional GGA
XC.authors PBE
PAO.BasisType split
PAO.BasisSize TZP
PAO.EnergyShift 0.005 Ry
Mesh.Cutoff 450 Ry
Spin non-polarized

ElectronicTemperature 25 meV
DM.Tolerance 1.0e-6
